(7306834, 1140299, 177322, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Nicely balanced subject across the square. Beautiful coloring and lighting. The texture is perfect. So simple, so enjoyable. Blue ribbon is my prediction. Best of luck.</td>', 'Stunning! Nicely balanced subject across the square. Beautiful coloring and lighting. The texture is perfect. So simple, so enjoyable. Blue ribbon is my prediction. Best of luck.', '2015-01-26 09:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
