(7310212, 1140365, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> It was a good idea, but the colour noise was very distracting :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t see any colour noise.  There is definitely some noise in the steam, but this was due to really having to push the whites in levels and contrast to get something that looked good.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: It was a good idea, but the colour noise was very distracting :)   I don''t see any colour noise.  There is definitely some noise in the steam, but this was due to really having to push the whites in levels and contrast to get something that looked good.', '2015-02-03 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
